ure.\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"AND\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Patients in a critical medical situation.\"\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n            }\n          },\n          \"right\": {\n            \"AND\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"raw_text\": \"Patients with a personal situation judged by the investigator as unlikely to be compatible with optimal participation in the study, or which could constitute a risk for the patient.\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Linguistic barrier or psychological profile preventing the patient from signing the consent form.\"\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n            }\n          },\n          \"right\": {\n            \"AND\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"raw_text\": \"Patient still in an exclusion period following the participation in another clinical trial.\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"raw_text\": \"Patients having earned more than 4500€ in indemnities for participation in clinical trials during the previous 12 months, including this study.\"\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}" 

