olume of blood or plasma (> 450 mL) within 28 days prior to the initial dose of study medication.\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"raw text\": \"7. Subjects who have received an investigational drug within 30 days prior to the initial dose of study medication.\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"raw text\": \"8. Allergy or hypersensitivity to metformin hydrochloride.\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"raw text\": \"9. History of difficulty in swallowing medication, or any gastrointestinal disorder which could affect the drug absorption.\"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n    }\n  }\n}" 

