diated or the last fraction of radiotherapy has been administered within approximately 3 weeks prior to randomization.\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"AND\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Brain metastases that are untreated, symptomatic, or require therapy to control symptoms or any radiation, surgery, or other therapy to control symptoms from brain metastases within 2 months prior to randomization.\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"AND\": {\n                        \"left\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"History of exposure to the following cumulative doses of anthracyclines: Doxorubicin or liposomal doxorubicin > 500 mg/m^2; epirubicin > 900 mg/m^2; mitoxantrone > 120mg/m^2 and idarubicin > 90 mg/m^2.\"\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"right\": {\n          \"AND\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"AND\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"raw text\": \"Current unstable angina.\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"AND\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw text\": \"History of symptomatic congestive heart failure, or ventricular arrhythmia requiring treatment.\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"AND\": {\n                        \"left\": {\n                          \"raw text\": \"History of myocardial infarction within 6 months prior to randomization.\"\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"right\": {\n          \"AND\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"AND\": {\n           