posed to practice contraception during the whole trial.\"\n                                        },\n                                        \"right\": {\n                                          \"AND\": {\n                                            \"left\": {\n                                              \"raw_text\": \"The patients underwent neoadjuvant chemotherapy plus surgery or directly modified radical mastectomy or breast-conserving surgery (plus sentinel lymph node biopsy or axillary lymph node dissection) after diagnosis of breast cancer.\"\n                                            },\n                                            \"right\": {\n                                              \"AND\": {\n                                                \"raw_text\": \"The patients underwent chemotherapy, radiation therapy or targeted therapy(herceptin) after surgery according to the 2013 NCCN guideline.\"\n                                                }\n                                            }\n                                          }\n                                        }\n                                    }\n                                  }\n                                }\n                            }\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"right\": {\n      \"AND\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"raw_text\": \"The results of patients' blood tests are as follows:\"\n        }\n    }\n  }\n}" 

