y obese or higher obesity classification (BMI =36); high blood pressure; high blood cholesterol; diabetes or high blood sugar; a first degree relative who had a heart condition before the age of 50; and current tobacco smokers.\"\n                    }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}" 

