atinine clearance <15 mL/min), have NYHA Functional class IV heart failure, or a systemic illness likely to limit survival to <1 year.\"\n                                    },\n                                    \"right\": {\n                                      \"AND\": {\n                                        \"left\": {\n                                          \"raw text\": \"Have had recent ST elevation myocardial infarction or non-ST elevation MI (< 30 days); note that biomarker elevation alone after ventricular arrhythmias does not denote MI.\"\n                                        },\n                                        \"right\": {\n                                          \"AND\": {\n                                            \"raw text\": \"Are pregnant.\"\n                                            }\n                                          }\n                                        }\n                                      }\n                                    }\n                                  }\n                                }\n                            }\n                          }\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}" 

