ites.\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"NOT\": {\n                        \"left\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"Prior diagnosis of a class IV cardiovascular disease (according to the New York Heart Association, 1964), hypothyroidism, diabetes mellitus, chronic kidney disease (С3-5), or disease of liver with portal hypertension and/or severe decompensation (Child-Pugh score > 6).\"\n                        \"right\": {\n                          \"NOT\": {\n                            \"left\": {\n                              \"raw_text\": \"Other severe coexisting morbidity which, in the investigator's opinion, can prevent the patient from participating in the study.\"\n                            }\n                          }\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"right\": {\n          \"AND\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"NOT\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw text\": \"Allergy/intolerance to any of the components of medications used in the treatment.\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"NOT\": {\n                        \"left\": {\n                          \"raw text\": \"Pregnancy, breast-feeding.\"\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"right\": {\n          \"AND\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"NOT\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw text\": \"Patients who, from investigator's point of view, will fail to comply with the observation requirements of the tri