arents, children or brothers (or sisters), regardless of whether they are natural or adopted.\"\n                        \"right\": {\n                          \"NOT\": {\n                            \"left\": {\n                              \"raw text\": \"Patient works for OOO "NPF "MATERIA MEDICA HOLDING" (i.e., is the company's employee, temporary contract worker or appointed official responsible for carrying out the research or their immediate family).\"\n                            }\n                          }\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n  }\n}" 

