\": {\n                    \"rawtext\": \"Currently taking anticoagulants, other than aspirin, unless the patient can be taken off the anticoagulant for surgery.\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"rawtext\": \"Subject has a current chemical/alcohol dependency or significant psychosocial disturbance.\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"rawtext\": \"Subject has a life expectancy of less than three (3) years.\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"rawtext\": \"Subject is currently involved in another investigational study.\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"rawtext\": \"Subject is incarcerated.\"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}" 

