ces that are incompatible with MRI imaging.\"\n                                                                    },\n                                                                    \"right\": {\n                                                                      \"OR\": {\n                                                                        \"raw text\": \"Radiation exposures exceeding annual Rad Worker limits.\"\n                                                                        },\n                                                                        \"right\": {\n                                                                          \"OR\": {\n                                                                            \"raw text\": \"Heart failure stage D as defined by American Heart Association (7).\"\n                                                                            },\n                                                                            \"right\": {\n                                                                              \"OR\": {\n                                                                                \"raw text\": \"Chronic kidney disease in stages = 4, as defined per National Kidney Foundation (8).\"\n                                                                                },\n                                                                                \"right\": {\n                                                                                  \"OR\": {\n                                                                                    \"raw text\": \"Brain tumor and other neoplastic disorders outside the brain where disease itself or its treatment (radiation, chemotherapy) is likely to affect brain structure or function.\"\n                                                                                    },\n                                                                                  